    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me under paragraph 154(f)4 of the 13th Amendment to the Constitution of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, P. B. Dissanayake, Governor of the North Central Province hereby notify that the Hon. S. M.Ranjith Samarakoon who was appointed to the office of the Chief Minister of the North Central Provincial Council with effectfrom 24.09.2012, was removed from that office on 28.01.2015.",
